Streamable vs Not Streamable
Unless defined as Streamable, Type Structures cannot be streamed, i.e. converted to Binary, see below:

 [
   Try( Ex ) Binary( APEx::Security PricingData() ) : String( EX );
   Binary( APEx::Test Tradable Data Price()  );
 ]
N.B: While Typed Structures are indeed streamable, it is not recommended to persist them in the DB as the logic to stream them is fragile. Use UFOs instead. See also:
